.TH CHM-INSTALL-GRAPHICS 1
.SH NAME
chm-install-graphics \- install or verify Mesa/OpenGL, GLFW and OpenCV
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B tools/graphics/install-opengl-opencv.sh
.B --install | --verify
.SH DESCRIPTION
Installs distribution packages for Mesa OpenGL/EGL, GLFW and OpenCV, or verifies pkg-config metadata and a headless renderer when Xvfb is available.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --install
Install packages using apt, dnf, pacman or Homebrew.
.TP
.B --verify
Print library versions and attempt a GL renderer probe.
